 "interpretation": "The white segmental ring continues into two jambs at the sides of a floor-height glazed opening. The close 2016 native original resolves two intermediate metal mullions, three tall glazed fields, and the dark threshold. In the 2023 group, the foreground hedge hides the lower jambs. The plaque and brick wall are coplanar within the available image resolution; the glass, its metal work and the foreground hedge do not share that plane."
